`defined term: Commonwealth legal unit of measurement (s 29A(2))` MEANS
    `Defined term` OF "Commonwealth legal unit of measurement", "s 29A(2)", "In this section", `worded as a closed meaning`, "Commonwealth legal unit of measurement means a unit of measurement prescribed under the Commonwealth Act.", ""

-- src:669 | newspaper shall mean a daily newspaper generally circulating in the district or place to which the matter required to be published relates or in which it arises.
@ref s 31(4) newspaper (src:669)
`defined term: newspaper (s 31(4))` MEANS
    `Defined term` OF "newspaper", "s 31(4)", "For the purposes of this section and of any such provisions", `worded as a closed meaning`, "newspaper shall mean a daily newspaper generally circulating in the district or place to which the matter required to be published relates or in which it arises.", ""

-- src:791 | prescribed instrument means an instrument of a legislative character, other than any proclamation or order-in-council referred to in subsection (1) or a regulation.
@ref s 38A(4) prescribed instrument (src:791)
`defined term: prescribed instrument (s 38A(4))` MEANS
