`defined term: Australia (s 43(1))` MEANS
    `Defined term` OF "Australia", "s 43(1)", "In any Act", `worded as a closed meaning`, "Australia means the Commonwealth of Australia and, when used in a geographical sense, does not include an external Territory;", ""

-- src:855 | British possession shall mean any part of the Sovereign's dominions, exclusive of the United Kingdom, and, where parts of such dominions are under both a central and a local legislature, all parts under such central legislature shall be deemed, for the purposes of this definition, to be one possession;
@ref s 43(1) British possession (src:855)
`defined term: British possession (s 43(1))` MEANS
    `Defined term` OF "British possession", "s 43(1)", "In any Act", `worded as a closed meaning`, "British possession shall mean any part of the Sovereign's dominions, exclusive of the United Kingdom, and, where parts of such dominions are under both a central and a local legislature, all parts under such central legislature shall be deemed, for the purposes of this definition, to be one possession;", ""

