-- src:1113 | (b) the ASIC Act, means regulations made, or that have effect as if they were made, under the ASIC Act;
@ref s 46AA ASIC Regulations (src:1109-1113)
`defined term: ASIC Regulations (s 46AA)` MEANS
    `Defined term` OF "ASIC Regulations", "s 46AA", "In any Act", `worded as the meaning given in another instrument`, "ASIC Regulations, when used in relation to – (a) the ASIC Law, has the meaning provided for by Part 11 of the Corporations (Tasmania) Act 1990; and (b) the ASIC Act, means regulations made, or that have effect as if they were made, under the ASIC Act;", "Corporations (Tasmania) Act 1990"

-- src:1115 | Corporations Act means the Corporations Act 2001 of the Commonwealth;
@ref s 46AA Corporations Act (src:1115)
`defined term: Corporations Act (s 46AA)` MEANS
    `Defined term` OF "Corporations Act", "s 46AA", "In any Act", `worded as a closed meaning`, "Corporations Act means the Corporations Act 2001 of the Commonwealth;", "Corporations Act; Corporations Act 2001 (Commonwealth)"

-- src:1117 | Corporations Law has the meaning provided for by Part 3 of the Corporations (Tasmania) Act 1990;
@ref s 46AA Corporations Law (src:1117)
`defined term: Corporations Law (s 46AA)` MEANS
    `Defined term` OF "Corporations Law", "s 46AA", "In any Act", `worded as the meaning given in another instrument`, "Corporations Law has the meaning provided for by Part 3 of the Corporations (Tasmania) Act 1990;", "Corporations (Tasmania) Act 1990"

-- src:1119 | Corporations legislation means the Corporations legislation to which Part 1.1A of the Corporations Act applies;
@ref s 46AA Corporations legislation (src:1119)
`defined term: Corporations legislation (s 46AA)` MEANS
    `Defined term` OF "Corporations legislation", "s 46AA", "In any Act", `worded as a closed meaning`, "Corporations legislation means the Corporations legislation to which Part 1.1A of the Corporations Act applies;", "Corporations Act"

-- src:1121 | Corporations Regulations, when used in relation to –
-- src:1123 | (a) the Corporations Law, has the meaning provided for by Part 3 of the Corporations (Tasmania) Act 1990; and
-- src:1125 | (b) the Corporations Act, means regulations made, or that have effect as if they were made, under the Corporations Act.
@ref s 46AA Corporations Regulations (src:1121-1125)
`defined term: Corporations Regulations (s 46AA)` MEANS
    `Defined term` OF "Corporations Regulations", "s 46AA", "In any Act", `worded as the meaning given in another instrument`, "Corporations Regulations, when used in relation to – (a) the Corporations Law, has the meaning provided for by Part 3 of the Corporations (Tasmania) Act 1990; and (b) the Corporations Act, means regulations made, or that have effect as if they were made, under the Corporations Act.", "Corporations (Tasmania) Act 1990; Corporations Act"

-- src:1139 | Commonwealth Act means the Australian Citizenship Act 1948 of the Commonwealth;
@ref s 46A(3) Commonwealth Act (src:1139)
`defined term: Commonwealth Act (s 46A(3))` MEANS
    `Defined term` OF "Commonwealth Act", "s 46A(3)", "In this section", `worded as a closed meaning`, "Commonwealth Act means the Australian Citizenship Act 1948 of the Commonwealth;", "Australian Citizenship Act 1948 (Commonwealth)"

-- src:1141 | law of the State means –
-- src:1143 | (a) an Act and any other law in force in the State;
-- src:1145 | (b) an instrument (including regulations) having effect by virtue of such an Act; and
-- src:1147 | (c) an instrument having effect by virtue of an instrument to which paragraph (b) of this definition relates.
@ref s 46A(3) law of the State (src:1141-1147)
`defined term: law of the State (s 46A(3))` MEANS
    `Defined term` OF "law of the State", "s 46A(3)", "In this section", `worded as a closed meaning`, "law of the State means – (a) an Act and any other law in force in the State; (b) an instrument (including regulations) having effect by virtue of such an Act; and (c) an instrument having effect by virtue of an instrument to which paragraph (b) of this definition relates.", ""

-- src:1159 | (1) In this section, written law means –
-- src:1161 | (a) an Act; or
-- src:1163 | (b) any other instrument of a legislative character.
@ref s 46C(1) written law (src:1159-1163)
`defined term: written law (s 46C(1))` MEANS
    `Defined term` OF "written law", "s 46C(1)", "In this section", `worded as a closed meaning`, "(1) In this section, written law means – (a) an Act; or (b) any other instrument of a legislative character.", ""

-- src:1245 | rules of court, used in relation to any Court, shall mean rules made by the authority having, for the time being, power to make rules or orders regulating the practice and procedure of such court.
@ref s 48(1) rules of court (src:1245)
`defined term: rules of court (s 48(1))` MEANS
    `Defined term` OF "rules of court", "s 48(1)", "In any Act", `worded as a closed meaning`, "rules of court, used in relation to any Court, shall mean rules made by the authority having, for the time being, power to make rules or orders regulating the practice and procedure of such court.", ""

